        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- **Native gesture navigation** — swipe up to go Home, swipe and hold to open the App Switcher, and swipe along the bottom edge to jump between apps\n- **Face ID-style status bar** — the modern iPhone X layout with the clock on the left and Control Center access from the top-right corner\n- **Lock Screen Quick Actions** — Flashlight and Camera buttons right on the Lock Screen"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Compatibility",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Supported on **iPhone 8**, **iPhone SE (2020)** and **iPhone SE (2022)** running **iOS 16.0 – 16.7.16**.\n\nIt may also work on iPhone 8 Plus, but this hasn't been tested yet."
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
